    },
    {
      "id": "01226a30-3630-42e5-8b64-0d823b5f8b86",
      "title": "Escute e leia a frase, observando a mudança no início.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "838f5111-315c-48e7-82d4-9075e4682ac8",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora a frase fala de mais de uma pessoa.</p><p><strong>Les gusta hablar español.</strong></p><p>Em português: Eles/Elas gostam de falar espanhol.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/02c30f28f65a4074af8398153255aafa_les-gusta-hablar-espanol.mp3?Expires=1794099439&Signature=SUojp3~bEjby28HA0sXrU-WI2BOmh0dfi9jvHJHhJfIWGz8PxC~6ktfSA0mTGdP-HBelITT6EzfqureYkYMsSlOr3zu3rvXAkWbmfzJiaIzql4Z3Bt4eXmqxTd2dkoYRBaAyR0bKaRhxj34fkgUOE1GY4rAE854QIhkNR1s2VrM5rxRCwOQwCg8skHPAglrXR~ChW4kpB58FbCc5PaOoy8rhvrpNb7zm2m3WJXfnWBkMWaKAy9rPzjfi3zTAGLebGbMpFDrYzdewvMH7fGNohjNu~8o3bEDDKJulKkT0dfde2x9VlXP6xJAELaDBlrY~JQPKlBZ48Db5rvXVH6QPlQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
